 ### Inputs and Outputs
-- **Inputs**: A set of $N$ input images $\{I_i\}_{i=1}^N$ with known camera poses $(K_i, T_i)$ and intrinsics $K_i$, captured under varying illumination. The number of views $N$ is small (e.g., $N=3$) [S1].
